{"title":"Paul Litvak’s Evidence Guide","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/973620947/0/marginalrevolution~Paul-Litvaks-Evidence-Guide.html","date":1795262336000,"content":"<blockquote><p>I’m excited to announce the launch of Evidence Guide, the place to store and find computational audits of papers. I built it to fill a major gap in research quality evaluation.</p></blockquote>\r\n<p>Here is <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/paullitvak/status/2123807585967165600?s=61\" target=\"_blank\">the rest of the thread</a>.  Here is <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://evidence.guide/\" target=\"_blank\">the site</a>.  This is happening quickly, people.  Via Andrea.</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/11/paul-litvaks-evidence-guide.html\">Paul Litvak’s Evidence Guide</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/973620947/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/973620947/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/973620947/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/973620947/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/19/973620947/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/email20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/20/973620947/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/rss20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://margin